      "stem": "Why does the man want the electronic file?",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "To change the report’s conclusions."
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "To make the text easier to read."
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "To print copies for a large meeting."
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "rationale": "A：没有要求更改结论；B：print small与enlarge screen明确放大阅读；C：未提出开大会或大量打印"
    },
