      "answer": "C",
      "rationale": "A：未提六点新班次；B：七点已取消；C：改乘八点明确为新安排"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "stem": "How does the man feel about the booking?",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "He regrets making it without that information."
        ],
