          "A",
          "Apply for a job driving a bus."
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "Prepare a new bus timetable."
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "Interview an experienced local driver."
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "rationale": "A：她在做广播项目，非应聘驾驶；B：beyond timetable不是编新时刻表；C：arranged to ask从业三十年司机社区变化，C准确"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "stem": "What does the man ask the woman to do?",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "Book the smaller room."
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "Cancel the larger room’s booking."
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "Invite more people to the meeting."
